g can use fewer.  \nTherefore the minimum possible number of tiles is precisely \\(2n-2\\).\n\nFor the given size \\(n=2025\\),\n\n\\[\n2n-2 = 2\\cdot2025-2 = 4050-2 = 4048 .\n\\]\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\\[\n\\boxed{4048}\n\\]"
